relevance: HIGH
title: Python 3.12 opcode.py — numeric opcode values for key control-flow opcodes
authors: Python core developers
year: 2023
venue: raw.githubusercontent.com/python/cpython/v3.12.0/Lib/opcode.py
quality: CODE
url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/python/cpython/v3.12.0/Lib/opcode.py
